The library (include/, src/), the compatibility shell (shim/), the tests
(tests/) and the build files are written for this project. They contain no
third-party code. The layout of the shared frame follows the emulator's
VideoFrameSharer.h in AOSP (platform/external/qemu, Apache-2.0); only the
layout is used, no code is copied. The exported names of the compatibility
shell match the functions MaaCore looks up in MuMu's external_renderer_ipc.dll;
the shell contains no code from MuMu or MaaCore.

scripts/privacy.py, scripts/repo_checks.py and scripts/test_repo_checks.py are
the ModAVD organisation's repository checks, copied unchanged from
ModAVDHostIME, where they are licensed under the GNU Affero General Public
License, version 3 or (at your option) any later version
(AGPL-3.0-or-later). They only run in CI and are not part of the library.

